DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nJay Reid LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\nJay R
	eid brings his “Comedy & Cocktails” show to the world-famous Jimmy Kimmel’
	s Comedy Club at the LINQ Promenade in Las Vegas on July 23\, 2026. This L
	as Vegas-raised comedian has won over millions with his sharp humor and in
	fectious energy — don’t miss this unforgettable night of laughs! \nEvent D
	etails\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Jimmy K
	immel’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109
	\nAge Requirement: 18+ (All shows are 18+ unless otherwise noted)\nParking
	: Available at Harrah’s\, Flamingo\, LINQ\, and surface lot. Up to 3 hours
	 free parking for locals. \nAbout Jay Reid\nJay Reid is a Las Vegas-raised
	 comedian and actor who rose to fame after winning Bill Bellamy’s “Who’s G
	ot Jokes?” on TV One. He has released three comedy specials including “L.M
	.A.O.” and “That Don’t Go Together” on Dry Bar+\, and has appeared on BET’
	s “Coming to the Stage” and Showtime’s “Ladies Night Out Comedy Special.” 
	His fourth special is on the way\, making this a must-see performance from
	 one of comedy’s rising stars. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious stand-up from
	 a Las Vegas native who knows how to work a crowd\nSharp comedy about rela
	tionships\, culture\, and everyday life\nIntimate comedy club setting with
	 cocktails and great vibes\nA performer with multiple TV specials and a pr
	oven track record\nOne of the hottest comedy nights on the Las Vegas Strip
	\n\nVenue Information\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is located at the LINQ P
	romenade on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering an intimate 325-seat venue with
	 a full bar and premium comedy entertainment nightly. The club features to
	p comedians from around the country in a fun\, upscale setting. \nTicket I
	nformation\nTickets start from $56. This is a general admission venue — se
	ating is assigned upon arrival. There is a 20-ticket limit per order. Tick
	ets available via Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOffici
	al Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a
	 commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to 
	you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID ma
	y be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/jay-reid-live
	-at-jimmy-kimmels-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
