DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nJay Mohr LIVE at Brea
	 Improv\nActor\, comedian\, and sports radio host Jay Mohr brings his stan
	d-up comedy to the Brea Improv for a multi-night run in July 2026. \nBest 
	known for his roles in Jerry Maguire\, Action\, and as a former cast membe
	r of Saturday Night Live\, Jay Mohr is also a seasoned stand-up comedian w
	ith a sharp\, quick wit. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026\
	nTime: 8:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddress: 1
	80 S Brea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: General A
	dmission\, first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase requir
	ed \nAbout Jay Mohr\nJay Mohr is a comedian\, actor\, and sports radio hos
	t best known for his role in Jerry Maguire and as a former SNL cast member
	. He has hosted Fox Sports Radio’s Jay Mohr Sports and released multiple s
	tand-up specials. His quick wit and storytelling ability make him a must-s
	ee live performer. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, quick-witted stand-up from 
	a Hollywood veteran\nStories from his career in film\, TV\, and sports med
	ia\nIntimate club setting at the Brea Improv\n21+ show with full bar and t
	wo-item minimum\n\nVenue Information\nBrea Improv is located at 180 S Brea
	 Blvd in Brea\, CA. Part of the legendary Improv comedy club chain in Oran
	ge County\, CA. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $25 (plus fees). \n
	Official Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post 
	contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets thr
	ough our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times 
	subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://co
	medycalendar.com/event/jay-mohr-live-at-brea-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calend
	ar
