SUMMARY:Jo Koy Live LIVE at Seminole Hard Rock Tampa Event Center
DTSTAMP:20260719T101345Z
DTSTART:20260723T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Jo Koy\nJo Koy is one
	 of today’s premier stand-up comedians\, rising from humble beginnings per
	forming in a Las Vegas coffee house to selling out arenas worldwide. Born 
	Joseph Glenn Herbert\, the Filipino-American comedian has built a massive\
	, devoted fanbase through his relatable\, high-energy storytelling and inf
	ectious laugh. \nKnown for his razor-sharp observational humor rooted in h
	is Filipino-American heritage and family life\, Jo Koy draws from real-lif
	e experiences — particularly the hilarious dynamics of raising his son and
	 navigating his large\, boisterous family. His comedy is warm\, inclusive\
	, and universally funny\, making audiences of all backgrounds feel right a
	t home. \nJo Koy has released multiple Netflix specials including Comin’ I
	n Hot\, In His Elements\, and Live from the Los Angeles Forum\, and was aw
	arded the prestigious “Stand-Up Comedian of the Year” at the 2018 Just For
	 Laughs Comedy Festival in Montreal. His 2026 “Jo Koy Live” tour continues
	 to pack venues across the country. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, Ju
	ly 23\, 2026\nShowtime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Seminole Hard Rock Tampa Event Cen
	ter\nAddress: 5223 N. Orient Road\, Tampa\, FL 33610\nAge Restriction: 21+
	 Event — Valid photo ID required for entry\nTicket Prices: Starting at $13
	5 (official) | $217–$675 (resale)\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Seminole Hard Ro
	ck Tampa Event Center is one of Florida’s premier entertainment venues\, l
	ocated inside the iconic Seminole Hard Rock Hotel & Casino Tampa. The stat
	e-of-the-art facility seats thousands of fans and offers an intimate yet e
	lectric atmosphere perfect for live comedy performances. \nThe venue featu
	res excellent sightlines from virtually every seat\, top-tier sound and li
	ghting systems\, and a full-service bar and dining experience. Guests can 
	enjoy the full Hard Rock casino resort experience before and after the sho
	w\, with world-class restaurants\, gaming floors\, and hotel accommodation
	s all on-site. \nParking is available on-site at the casino complex. The v
	enue is located at 5223 N. Orient Road in Tampa\, easily accessible from I
	-4 and I-75. Guests are encouraged to arrive early to enjoy the resort ame
	nities and ensure smooth entry into the Event Center. \nWhat to Expect\nJo
	 Koy delivers a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud stand-up performance that ble
	nds personal storytelling\, family humor\, and sharp cultural observations
	. Expect a full evening of comedy with Jo Koy headlining — his shows are k
	nown for running approximately 90 minutes to 2 hours of non-stop entertain
	ment. \nThis is a 21+ event\, so guests must bring a valid photo ID. The s
	how is presented in a concert-style seated format inside the Hard Rock Eve
	nt Center. Fans can expect callbacks to his popular Netflix specials as we
	ll as brand-new material from his 2026 tour. \nWhether you’re a longtime f
	an or discovering Jo Koy for the first time\, this is a night of comedy yo
	u won’t want to miss. His ability to connect with audiences through genuin
	e\, heartfelt humor makes every show feel personal and unforgettable. \nTi
	cket Information\nOfficial Tickets: Starting at $135 via Ticketmaster\nRes
	ale Tickets: $217–$675 via VividSeats \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets
	\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purcha
	se tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are fina
	l. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
	\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/jo-koy-live-live-at-seminole-hard-roc
	k-tampa-event-center/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jo-koy-live-live-at-seminole-hard-rock
	-tampa-event-center/
LOCATION:Seminole Hard Rock Tampa Event Center\, 5223 N. Orient Road\, Tamp
	a\, Florida\, 33610\, United States
